  {
    "abstract": "This SMPTE Technical Specification specifies an Application Constraint of SMPTE ST 2067 - the Interoperable Master Format Application #2E. The purpose of an application constraint is to provide a reduced set of technical parameters based around a defined use-case, which can be implemented in a common way by multiple implementers. Editorial constraints that are relevant to a specific content provider will be specified separately.",
